DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T150000
SUMMARY:Metrowest Legal Services Quarterly Clinic
LOCATION:Norwood Senior Center — 275 Prospect Street\, Norwood\, MA 02062
DESCRIPTION:Metrowest Legal Services Quarterly Clinic - Monday\, October 19th\, 1:00pm-3:00pm. Please call me to schedule a 20-minute appointment with Attorney Vera Ochea. Attorney Ochea can discuss the following types of law with you: Housing\, Public Benefits\, SSA\, Durable POA\, HCP\, Simple Probate\, Medicaid\, Nursing Home\, Consumer and Bankruptcy. Confirm registration requirements with the Senior Center.\nSource: https://www.norwoodma.gov/document_center/Senior/Newsletters/20261001N.pdf?t=202609281323560
URL:https://www.norwoodma.gov/document_center/Senior/Newsletters/20261001N.pdf?t=202609281323560
END:VEVENT
